Tentu mereka akan lawan habis-habisan.

551
00:49:27,381 --> 00:49:31,093
Lebih mudah kalau kita serang mereka
bersama-sama.

552
00:49:33,428 --> 00:49:39,518
Sembunyi elok-elok
Jangan biar rambutmu jadi petunjuk

553
00:49:39,601 --> 00:49:40,727
Awak okey?

554
00:49:40,811 --> 00:49:42,437
Puan Geum-ja, Jun-hee.

555
00:49:44,856 --> 00:49:45,691
Ikut saya.

556
00:49:45,774 --> 00:49:51,029
Sembunyi elok-elok
Jangan biar rambutmu jadi petunjuk

557
00:49:51,655 --> 00:49:53,115
